    "name": "CadenceConfig",
    "overview": "Serves the Cadence music client its runtime config and proxies Lidarr requests server-side.",
    "description": "CadenceConfig lets a Jellyfin server operator set the Cadence client's runtime config (marlin search URL, sign-up URL, cast receiver id) once in the plugin dashboard so every client \u2014 web and native iOS \u2014 is auto-configured at sign-in. It also proxies the client's 'request missing music' calls to Lidarr through a curated allowlist, injecting the Lidarr API key server-side so the write credential never reaches a client.",
